ADDITIONAL USE NOTICE (non-binding)

This software is a DEFENSIVE security simulation platform. It is intended for
authorized security testing, education, and blue-team/CTEM workflows against
assets you own or are explicitly permitted to assess. Do not use it to attempt
unauthorized access to systems you do not own. The simulation-only scope
described in the README is a design property, not a license restriction.
